                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Abortion rights are on the ballot \u2013 even in New Jersey.\n\nI\u2019m proud to stand alongside Dr. Brandi, a NJ OB/GYN, who shared the dangers of a national abortion ban for patients and providers alike. Read more:\n\nhttps://t.co/KzWpQevNtJ",
