                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Sometimes I hear people say that reproductive freedom is not an issue in New Jersey or that we don\u2019t need further protections for abortion rights. \n\nBut just today, Trump rescinded guidance that prevented hospitals from turning away pregnant women who are in the midst of medical emergencies. MAGA extremists \u2014 including Jack Ciattarelli \u2014 are not done coming after our reproductive rights.",
