                "text": "400,000 New Jerseyans will lose their health insurance.\n\n450,000 more will see their premiums double.\n\n200,000 will lose food assistance.\n\nUtility costs will go up by hundreds of dollars for every New Jerseyan.\n\nThe SALT cap, which was set to expire, will be reinstated.",
