                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hey @jack4NJ, the bill Trump championed and you cheered on is causing premiums to skyrocket for over 450,000 New Jerseyans.\n\nWe're in an affordability crisis. Are you still saying you can't come up with a single thing you disagree with him on?\n\nhttps://t.co/ElSw9gGB1Y",
