                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For 60 years, Medicare and Medicaid have been a lifeline for New Jersey\u2019s families, seniors, veterans, and people with disabilities.\n\nBut now, Republicans like @Jack4NJ are gutting Medicaid coverage for New Jerseyans.\n\nThey\u2019ll all face voters at the ballot box eventually \u2014 but New Jersey will hold Jack accountable in less than 100 days.",
