                "retweet_count": 39,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our healthcare system fails Black women every day \u2014 with deadly consequences. I\u2019ve heard from women all over New Jersey who\u2019ve lived this injustice.\n\nAs governor, I\u2019ll change that by investing in doulas and midwives, expanding telehealth, and holding hospitals accountable. Black women deserve better.",
