                "text": "The Trump economy has tanked job growth to its lowest point since 2020. Between the tariffs, rising unemployment, and soaring health insurance premiums, @Jack4NJ says we should feel this \"pain\" \u2014 all while pushing a 10% sales tax on food and clothes.\n\nNew Jersey CANNOT afford Jack Ciattarelli.",
